Upstream dataset.

The SecLists file above is itself derived from the "ten million passwords" data set published
by Mark Burnett (xato.net).

Original dataset: Mark Burnett (xato.net)
Publication: "Today I Am Releasing Ten Million Passwords", 02.09.15, archived copy
https://web.archive.org/web/20150211131735/https://xato.net/passwords/ten-million-passwords/
(verified_on 2026-11-11).
Public-domain statement, quoted from that post:
  "So I built a data set of ten million usernames and passwords that I am releasing to the
  public domain."
  "This data is extremely valuable for academic and research purposes and for furthering
  authentication security and this is why I have released it to the public domain."

The footer of that site reads: "This work by Mark Burnett is licensed under a Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported License . Any use of this content must include attribution
to Mark Burnett (xato.net)." It is reproduced here for completeness; it appears to cover the
site's articles, and attribution is given regardless.
